# IdeaForge uses two env files:
#   server/.env  — see server/.env.example (PORT, MONGODB_URI, AI_PROVIDER, AI_API_KEY, AI_MODEL, CLIENT_URL)
#   client/.env  — see client/.env.example (VITE_API_BASE_URL)
# Copy each example next to it:  cp server/.env.example server/.env && cp client/.env.example client/.env
